  "question": {
    "text": "Mr. Vipin, a famous liar, is known to speak the truth <math><mn>5</mn></math> out of <math><mn>6</mn></math> times. His blind folded friend Shubham throws a pair of dice and asked Vipin the result, who says the sum of numbers on the pair of dice is <math><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The probability that the sum of numbers on the pair of dice is actually <math><mn>9</mn></math> is <math><mi>k</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mn>52</mn><mi></mi><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "20",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be an event that Vipin speaks the truth<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math><br />and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> be an event such that the sum on the pair of dice is equal to <math><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">C</mi></msup></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
}